hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"215","It is narrated on the authority of Salam bin Junada, on the authority of Waki’, on the authority of Shu’bah, on the authority of Al-Hakam, on the authority of Ibrahim, on the authority of Al-Aswad, on the authority of Aisha, that the Prophet, may God’s prayers and peace be upon him He said: “If he wants to eat or sleep while he is in a state of sexual intercourse, he performs ablution.”"
